              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage oral hygiene systems for ventilated patients</span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The risk of ventilator-associated pneumonia is real. Reducing this threat takes a concentrated and coordinated effort. Our oral care kits for ventilated patients can help you perform appropriate oral care efficiently and effectively.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 31 2024 17:57:24 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
